 src=\"https://gis.dubuquecounty.us//Elections/Icons/Mail.svg\" alt=\"Email\">\r\n            </a>\r\n            <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/DubuqueCountyElections\">\r\n              <img src=\"https://www.dubuquecountyiowa.gov/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=7146\" alt=\"Facebook\">\r\n            </a>\r\n            <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXFvtJQ2WWIsG8vVFVreYCQ\">\r\n              <img src=\"https://www.dubuquecountyiowa.gov/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=7149\" alt=\"YouTube\">\r\n            </a>\r\n            <div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"footer footer-background\">\r\n            <p><img src=\"https://www.dubuquecountyiowa.gov/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=7170\" alt=\"County Logo\">  Powered by Dubuque County, Iowa</p>\r\n    </div>\n"
